      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_68eaaaef008d6b8a8082f260556abc24c9c863c8c2f911325327aed9bd4b3567"
      ],
      "text": "The project builds on the sendaifun/solana-agent-kit library, which the README cites as the underlying SEND AI technology."
    },
    {
