      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_f1136159ddeff87ee09e84b80973a13c8445497bf9cc6a1324293ad614d4596a"
      ],
      "text": "The upstream Eliza changelog indicates the underlying framework supports Solana token operations such as creating, buying, and selling tokens via a plugin-solana bonding-curve integration, which is relevant to this repo's token-deployment purpose."
    },
