        "slc_68eaaaef008d6b8a8082f260556abc24c9c863c8c2f911325327aed9bd4b3567"
      ],
      "text": "The README's claims about agent creation, token deployment, and airdropping are documentation statements only; the supplied evidence contains no source code demonstrating this behavior, so the described functionality is unverified in this snapshot."
